{"3842360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VALKYRA: Red Meridian", "steam_appid": 3842360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valkyra</strong> is a solo-developed, open-world action roguelite set in a future on the verge of collapse. After humanity’s first contact with extraterrestrials, Earth and time itself have catastrophically fractured. Travel across eras and broken timelines to close the fractures before reality shatters completely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Open-World Action</strong><br>Switch instantly between high-speed driving and intense on-foot combat at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong><br>Third-person gunplay combined with explosive abilities and physics driven melee combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nether-Storm</strong><br>Clear zones, stock up, and survive before the timeline collapses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression System</strong><br>Level up and unlock new abilities with each run. Choose the best upgrades to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Upgrades</strong><br>Permanently unlock new vehicles, better weapons, and devastating abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle-Based Gameplay</strong><br>Speed through landscape in futuristic cars to navigate collapsing world.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valkyra</strong> is a solo-developed, open-world action roguelite set in a future on the verge of collapse. After humanity’s first contact with extraterrestrials, Earth and time itself have catastrophically fractured. Travel across eras and broken timelines to close the fractures before reality shatters completely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Featu